cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PersonaJury, please cite it as below."
title: PersonaJury
version: 0.6.1
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/massrelay-ai/personajury"
abstract: >-
  A persona jury as an engine: a Rust CLI and MCP server that stores personas, panels, lenses, subjects and comparators,
  composes deterministic briefs, ingests the verdicts an agent's subagents write, refuses verdicts without evidence, and
  reports scores per stratum. The engine never calls a model.
keywords:
  - persona jury
  - synthetic users
  - ai personas
  - design review
  - rubric
  - evidence
  - mcp
authors:
  - given-names: Nicholas Andrea
    family-names: Sujitno
    email: support@massrelay.ai
